    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#1$3",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#1$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, Saki. Drink.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#3$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_drinkswllw",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "My throat doesn't hurt so much now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good. Here. For you. Rim Billiton is all dust and sand. You need waterskins and goggles.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_pcket",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko takes each item as Mutsumi offers them. She clutches them tightly. The swollen waterskin looks fit to burst."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#16$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Saki. You seem bad. Are you sick?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, it's nothing...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mutsumi, you... remember me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You remember all the things we've been through?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmhm. I remember all of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko feels she can finally relax a little. She casts her gaze around\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "The long, narrow mineshaft they have been following dives deep into the ground, all the way down to here."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is damp and dark, with only oil lanterns and stoves to provide feeble pinpricks of light."
    },
    {
        "text": "There is space for only one between the bed and dining table, and based on the number of cups on that table, Mutsumi is not living here alone."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mutsumi, how... how long have you been living here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A year. Maybe more. There's nothing complicated to think about here, and time doesn't pass that clearly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... You can't sense the passing of time because you're in a dream.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mutsumi, why would you dream of <i>this</i>...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#16$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dream...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have something very important to tell you, Mutsumi. None of this is real. We need to\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh hello, now\u2014back already, Mutsumi-chan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_runstop",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_kneelsnow_s",
        "volume": 1,
        "delay": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 12,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone rushes in behind them, and tackles Mutsumi straight down on the soft bed."
    },
    {
        "text": "M-Mum, you're all dusty, get off of me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, but we haven't seen each other in nearly a day! Just let me hug you a bit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "W-We have guests...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#1$3",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh! If it isn't Saki-chan!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "text": "You haven't come over to ours in how long, now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Minami-san...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, no need to be so formal, just 'Minami' will do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmhm. Sometimes I call Mum that too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mutsumi, since when did you have such a good relationship with Minami-san...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've always had one! We're mother and daughter, after all~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mutsumi-chan, how were today's earnings?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sifts through pockets) It was hot today, so more people wanted cucumber juice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mutsumi carefully opens the pouch in her hand. Within are a scant few coins."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hooh\u2014attagirl, Mutsumi-chan!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sifts through pockets) Here, here's what I got.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#15$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow... You're amazing, Mum.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aren't I? I don't know why, but today I had a lot more people wanting their clothes mended!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your dad's been working hard too, putting in a full day's work at the construction site. When I went to drop off his lunch and saw his dust-covered face and exhausted look, I gave him special permission to go for a pint after work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sure by now, he's downed a whole tanker!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And to top it all off, now Saki-chan's here! You know what time I think it is? Time to get everyone together for dinner!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm glad. Eating with everyone is really nice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't it just! And today was such a good day for us, we can't go being stingy now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Saki-chan, don't be shy! You're invited too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#16$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Saki. What's wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... Nothing...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're clearly not a prosperous family. The bare mud walls, the dim lantern light..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Why would Mutsumi's dream be like this?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4081_warmy_1#11$2",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4081_warmy_1#11$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello, Mutsumi, Minami... Oh, who's this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warmy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's a friend from childhood. Saki.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4081_warmy_1#4$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warmy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4081_warmy_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I came over to ask if you all wanted dinner?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warmy"
    },
    {
        "text": "I made a lot tonight, and if you'd like, we can eat together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warmy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Now can we really accept?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4081_warmy_1#10$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your neighbors say there hasn't been smoke from your chimney for a few days now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warmy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#10$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Rubs stomach) Mmnh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4081_warmy_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, it's been almost a month since the last party, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warmy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone really wants to see Mutsumi perform again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warmy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, if that's the case... What do you think, Mutsumi-chan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#5$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "M-M... Me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sure you want to see too, right, Saki? I could listen to it a hundred more times and still not get tired!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you don't mind, we can hold the party at ours! What a coincidence, we were just talking about inviting everyone over for dinner!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Saki, what do you think?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think... you should make the decision, Mutsumi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mm. I'm okay with it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
