        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Rowdy chatter, hearty laughs, clanking cups."
    },
    {
        "text": "The cramped house is stuffed full with people, but nobody seems to mind the lack of space."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, alright, time for another round!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, a warm welcome to Mutsumi-chan's pal\u2014Sakiko!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eyyy! Hello, Sakiko!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Everyone"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone turns to look at her, sitting in the corner."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Lifting her pint glass) Sakiko...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ch\u2014Cheers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cheers\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Everyone"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$clink"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$clink",
        "loop": false,
        "channel": 1,
        "delay": 0.04
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "With her welcomed, everyone's attention returns to the party. Sakiko leans against the wall alone, her eyes a mix of emotions as she watches it all unfold."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3",
        "posfrom": "-150,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Saki.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mutsumi...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#10$3",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually... I know about it all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#10$3",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is all fake. Minami being so nice to me. It's all fake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-This\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#14$3",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "So when I saw you, I knew, it was time to go back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... give me a chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "text": "A chance to say goodbye. Then we can end it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, I can sing freely, just like everyone else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mutsumi...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_walk_stage",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "nw"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "channel": "nw"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before Sakiko can even respond, Mutsumi picks up her guitar, and slowly walks up to the crowd."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You all ready, Mutsumi-chan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#16$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hi, everyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cheer_street",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#16$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#9$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#10$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it, Mutsumi-chan? Something wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#16$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Chair. My chair.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1939_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "All ready for you. This one, yeah? The one you normally use?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi's Mother"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mutsumi stares intently at the stool, its seat covered in deep cracks."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4183_mortis_1#13$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm. That's it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothtrailground",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She slowly sits down. Everyone quiets their breathing."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_black",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Here goes. Please enjoy...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Haruhikage</i>.",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Mutsumi Wakaba"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "65_i07_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$warm_intro",
        "key": "$warm_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "A melody Sakiko could never forget comes to life once more in Mutsumi's dream."
    },
    {
        "text": "The same warm tone she remembered subtly soothes the hearts of all present."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Mutsumi Wakaba before her is almost a stranger to Sakiko."
    },
    {
        "text": "She is no longer the Mutsumi who struggles to express herself."
    },
    {
        "text": "While her emotional expressions are still not very rich, here and now, she seems... so happy."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.4,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "'A heart grown numb with cold, a trembling gaze'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 270,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\n'In all the world, I was alone'",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\n'All I knew of spring was falling petals'",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\n'And every year, my feelings are brushed off with indifference'",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So this is what you wished for, Mutsumi...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko has had countless opportunities to pull Mutsumi away from here, and she is certain Mutsumi would follow if she did."
    },
    {
        "text": "But ultimately, she cannot bring herself to do it."
    },
    {
        "text": "Not when this Mutsumi is so very happy."
    },
    {
        "text": "The crowd lightly sways to the music. The feeble candlelight casts their shadows against the wall, like warm spring sunlight casting lilting shadows of trees."
    },
    {
        "text": "Mutsumi sits on her stool, surrounded by all. Her eyes are closed, and as she strums, she gently sings."
    },
    {
        "text": "What is on her mind in this moment?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.4,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "'Heart-rending and endearing'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 230,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\n'Now that I'm here, now that I feel'",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\n'Heartwarming and tormenting'",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\n'That me who couldn't cry that day'",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\n'The light gently guides that me along with it\u2014'",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Some indescribable emotion clouds Sakiko's mind."
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it gratification... or a refusal to accept things? Perhaps, a mix of the two."
    },
    {
        "text": "Mutsumi Wakaba, as she is now, is much happier than when she was with Sakiko."
    },
    {
        "text": "She sits there, alone on her stool, earnestly singing this familiar song."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.4,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "'Shimmering and sparkling, sail through the clouds'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 200,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\n'My heart filled, it overflows'",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\n'Shimmering and sparkling, down my cheeks, unnoticed'",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\n'Burning, scorching, wetting my skin'",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\n'Why is your hand so very warm?'",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\n\\n'Please, just stay like this and don't let go of my hands\u2014'",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If she does not let go\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then the happiness Mutsumi has found here\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_openftstprun",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "nrun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "nrun",
        "fadetime": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "65_i07_2",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 2.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko turns, and runs away in a panic."
    },
    {
        "text": "And like that, she disappears into the night."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
